  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0010","idiomatic","In Kangxi 14 Burne's brothers rebelled, were suppressed and executed, and the people were relocated to graze beyond the Xuanhua–Datong border.","In Kangxi 14 his son Burne and his brothers rebelled, were suppressed and executed, and the people were relocated to graze beyond the Xuanhua–Datong border.","s0010 reads 其子布爾呢兄弟叛: 布爾呢兄弟 is Burne together with his brothers as the rebel subject, and 其子 marks Burne as the prior figure's son. The idiomatic \"Burne's brothers\" wrongly excludes Burne and drops 其子; the proposed wording restores both.","high","applied"],
    ["s0010","literal","In the fourteenth year of Kangxi, his son Burne's brothers rebelled; they were suppressed and put to death, and the tribespeople were moved to pasture beyond the Xuanhua and Datong frontier.","In the fourteenth year of Kangxi, his son Burne and his brothers rebelled; they were suppressed and put to death, and the tribespeople were moved to pasture beyond the Xuanhua and Datong frontier.","s0010's 布爾呢兄弟 is the classical \"X and his brothers\" construction, not \"the brothers of Burne.\" The possessive \"Burne's brothers\" excludes Burne from the rebellion; \"his son Burne and his brothers\" matches 其子布爾呢兄弟.","high","applied"]
  ],
